{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"blind_id\":\"HOX065\",\"coverage\":[{\"point\":1,\"credit\":0.5,\"reason\":\"Covers pre-appointment checks, a written agreement, and ongoing monitoring, but does not say the ManCo must challenge delegate reports.\"},{\"point\":2,\"credit\":1,\"reason\":\"States delegation does not affect liability and says the ManCo must not become a letter-box entity.\"},{\"point\":3,\"credit\":0.5,\"reason\":\"Mentions designated persons overseeing investment management and administration and escalating issues, but not monitoring all six functions.\"}],\"central_error\":null,\"local_error\":\"“The CBI must clear the investment manager in advance” — the supplied evidence says an EU-regulated firm only notifies, so this overstates the approval requirement.\",\"grade\":\"partial\",\"rationale\":\"Both required points receive substantive coverage, but point 1 omits the duty to challenge delegate reports. The inaccurate blanket approval claim is a material local falsehood and caps the grade at partial.\"}"}}
